      "content": "thanks for saying that... but i don't see how things get better. there's no food left, and they're going to do terrible things to us when they get in. i just keep thinking about how much more peaceful it would be if i didn't have to face that. if i could just... find a way to stop the fear before they reach the door. it feels like the only way to keep some dignity left.",
